      folk: [
        "Every so often, the whole world turns upside down and it snows for an hour. You get used to it.",
        "It's always snowing here. Always winter. Always cosy. We've never seen a summer. We don't miss it.",
        "There's a huge face that looks in at us through the glass sometimes. It smiles. We wave.",
        "Our snowmen never melt. Some of them are older than the town. They've got very wise carrot noses.",
        "When the music box below plays, everybody dances in the square. It only knows the one tune.",
        "Chestnuts roasting, carols singing, skating on the pond. It's always the best night of the year.",
        "The edge of the world is glass. You can see out. There's a huge room out there, with a fireplace.",
        "The snow never gets dirty here. It just swirls round and round and settles again, perfectly white.",
      ],
