        "From the window you can see Earth rising over the horizon. Blue and white. Everyone stops to look.",
        "There's no air outside, so no sound. You could shout as loud as you like. Nobody would hear.",
        "A day here lasts about a month. The sun's up for two weeks, then it's dark for two weeks. Very long nights.",
