        "Moon dust gets everywhere. It's sharp and sticky and it smells like spent fireworks.",
        "We grow lettuce in the green dome. Moon lettuce. It tastes exactly like normal lettuce. Disappointing.",
        "Some kids here have never been to Earth. They think rain's a fairy tale.",
